{"id":"DRKS00015151","src":"drks","title":"Development of a Risk Prediciton Model for Chemotherapy-induced Nausea and Vomiting","official":"","summary":"In the first step (1) patients will be asked to complete a questionnaire concerning their personal risk factors for nausea and emesis. We will try to find connections between the risk factors and the development of nausea and vomiting with the aim of creating a model for calculating the patient’s personal risk. In the second step (2) of the study this model will be applied to a larger number of patients preceding treatment and its predictive value will be examined.\r\nExamined will be female patients with gynaecological cancer.","conditions":["gynaecological cancer"],"interventions":[{"type":"ARM","name":"Standard chemotherapy; during therapy nausea and vomiting will be recorded via patient questionnaires and daily diary.\r\nNo interventions will be performed."}],"criteria":"Inclusion criteria:\n- Diagnosis with primary gynaecological cancer and/or breast cancer\r\n- Planned chemotherapy for at least three cycles, adjuvant and neoadjuvant (as standard of care)\nExclusion criteria:\n- Chemotherapy has already started\r\n- Tumour of a different origin\r\n- Metastases in the central nervous system\r\n- Bowel obstruction/ Ileus/ Subileus","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"FEMALE","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":null,"start":"2019-05-22","pcd":"","upd":"2026-03-18","sponsor":"NOGGO e.V. Nord-Ostdeutsche Gesellschaft für Gynäkologische Onkologie","areas":["oncology"],"central":["NOGGO e.V. Nord-Ostdeutsche Gesellschaft für Gynäkologische Onkologie · +49 30 403 68 65 - 30 · studies@noggo.de"],"sites":[{"f":"Charite","city":"Berlin","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":52.5244,"lon":13.4105},{"f":"Carl-Thiem Klinikum","city":"Cottbus","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"","c":"","lat":51.7577,"lon":14.3289},{"f":"Carl Gustav Carus Universitätsmedizin","city":"Dresden","zip":"","s":"R","pr":"",